    description: "Token on its own line that separates chapters or scenes (default: ***)."
  - name: chapter_title_bracketed
    prettyName: Detect Bracketed Chapter Titles
    type: boolean
    default: true
    description: "Detect bracketed headers like [ Chapter 1: Title ]. Bracketed metadata such as [ Author: X; Tags: Y ] is always ignored. Same rules as Chapter Linter."
